      <p>Common signs include the door being louder than usual, jerky or shaky movement, the opener struggling to lift the door, visible rust on cables or springs, the door feeling heavy when lifted manually, squeaking or grinding noises, or if you simply can't remember the last time it was serviced. Any change in how your door operates is worth having professionally inspected.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
 
  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-question">
      <span>Will maintenance prevent my garage door from breaking?</span>
      <span class="faq-arrow">&#9654;</span>
    </div>
